The Meadowbrook Extravaganza is our annual summer celebration - a day of live music, food, stalls, and fun for all the family on the Meadowbrook site.

our take on the classic village fete. We are looking for people to run stalls, perform music, and help with the organisation. If you would like to get involved, please get in touch.

